## Env contract

- `env.example` documents required variables without values.
- The secrets layer is being redesigned (`hq secret` is a stub); repo-scoped
  1Password loading will return with it. Item names stay scoped inside the
  company vault: `Work-${CO}` item `${PROD}__${REPO}__<VARNAME>`.
- Agents may document missing env vars, but must not write secret values to
  `.env*`, `.envrc`, docs, logs, or code.

